---
import '../styles/insight-stack.css';
const bars=[22,30,27,42,38,49,44,62,55,68,76,71,86,93];
---
<div class="insight-stack" aria-label="DryDock product previews">
<div class="stack-caption"><span>YOUR ENGINEERING STORY, CONNECTED</span><span>Illustrative product data</span></div>
<div class="stack-deck">
<section class="insight-sheet" data-sheet="0" data-depth="0" aria-label="AI investment and productivity">
<div class="sheet-bar"><span><img src="/drydock-logo-tile.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26"/>DryDock <b>AI</b></span><span>Engineering impact</span><small>Last 30 days</small></div>
<div class="sheet-workspace-nav"><span>Workspace</span><b>Overview</b><span>Changes</span><span>Insights</span><span>Evidence</span><i>● Connected</i></div><div class="sheet-body"><div class="sheet-heading"><div><span>01 / MEASURE THE VALUE</span><h3>Engineering impact</h3><p>AI adoption → measurable delivery performance</p></div><span class="sheet-badge green">Impact overview</span></div>
<div class="sheet-metrics">{[['AI utilization','74%','↑ 28% adoption'],['Developer throughput','+31%','vs. pre-AI baseline'],['Cycle time','−22%','code to production'],['Value / cost','2.3×','illustrative estimate']].map(([title,value,desc])=><div><span>{title}</span><strong>{value}</strong><small>{desc}</small></div>)}</div>
<div class="sheet-charts"><div class="sheet-chart"><div class="chart-label"><strong>Delivery throughput</strong><span>Before AI <i/> With AI</span></div><div class="stack-bars">{bars.map(n=><div><i style={`height:${n*.65}%`}/><b style={`height:${n}%`}/></div>)}</div><div class="chart-axis"><span>Week 1</span><span>Week 2</span><span>Week 3</span><span>Week 4</span></div></div><div class="sheet-chart trend-chart"><strong>Cycle time</strong><span>Less time from code to production</span><svg viewBox="0 0 300 110" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative downward cycle-time trend"><path d="M0 25H300M0 60H300M0 95H300" stroke="#e8eff8"/><path d="m3 15 28 9 23-4 23 21 25-5 22 17 26-9 23 23 27-3 25 17 24-5 24 15" fill="none" stroke="#00b88a" stroke-width="3"/></svg><strong class="trend-number">−22% <small>cycle time</small></strong></div></div>
<div class="sheet-insight"><span>✦</span><p><strong>31% more throughput. 22% shorter cycles.</strong> Compare AI adoption with the delivery outcomes it supports.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="insight-sheet" data-sheet="1" data-depth="1" aria-label="Release confidence" inert>
<div class="sheet-bar"><span><img src="/drydock-logo-tile.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26"/>DryDock <b>AI</b></span><span>Release governance</span><small>Release 4.2</small></div>
<div class="sheet-workspace-nav"><span>Workspace</span><b>Overview</b><span>Changes</span><span>Insights</span><span>Evidence</span><i>● Connected</i></div><div class="sheet-body"><div class="sheet-heading"><div><span>02 / GOVERN THE CHANGE</span><h3>Payment reconciliation</h3><p>PR #1291 · feature/payment-reconcile → main</p></div><span class="sheet-badge amber">Review required</span></div>
<div class="sheet-pipeline">{['Build','Tests','Security','Deploy'].map((name,i)=><div class:list={{blocked:i===3}}><span>{i===3?'!':'✓'}</span><strong>{name}</strong><small>{i===3?'Held for approval':'Passed'}</small></div>)}</div>
<div class="sheet-review"><div><span class="sheet-label">POLICY PAY-07</span><h4>Payment changes require senior review.</h4><p>Payment logic changed in 3 files. PAY-07 requires a senior engineer’s approval before deployment.</p><span class="missing-record">⊗ No approval evidence found.</span></div><div class="sheet-review-evidence"><strong>Ready for the tech lead</strong><span>✓ Code diff · 3 changed files</span><span>✓ 41 checks · 92% test coverage</span><span>✓ Security results attached</span><button type="button" id="stack-policy-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="stack-policy-detail">View policy details →</button></div></div><p id="stack-policy-detail" class="stack-policy-detail" hidden>PAY-07 requires a senior engineer’s approval, identity and timestamp for AI-assisted payment-code changes. Release 4.2 stays blocked until that decision is recorded.</p>
<div class="sheet-insight amber"><span>!</span><p><strong>Checks passed. Human approval pending.</strong> The release stays on hold until the tech lead records a decision.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="insight-sheet" data-sheet="2" data-depth="2" aria-label="Connected release evidence" inert>
<div class="sheet-bar"><span><img src="/drydock-logo-tile.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26"/>DryDock <b>AI</b></span><span>Release evidence</span><small>PR #1291</small></div>
<div class="sheet-workspace-nav"><span>Workspace</span><b>Overview</b><span>Changes</span><span>Insights</span><span>Evidence</span><i>● Connected</i></div><div class="sheet-body"><div class="sheet-heading"><div><span>03 / PROVE THE OUTCOME</span><h3>Release evidence</h3><p>Release 4.2 · Linked signals across your engineering stack</p></div><span class="sheet-badge amber">1 missing record</span></div>
<div class="sheet-evidence-grid"><div class="evidence-sources">{[['jira','Jira','Intent · PAY-482'],['github','GitHub','Change · PR #1291'],['gitlab','CI/CD','Verification · 41 checks'],['','Security','Risk · no blocking findings']].map(([icon,name,detail])=><div>{icon?<img src={`/${icon}.svg`} width="24" height="24" alt=""/>:<span>♧</span>}<p><strong>{name}</strong><small>{detail}</small></p><b>→</b></div>)}</div><div class="release-record"><span class="sheet-label">RELEASE 4.2 / DECISION RECORD</span><h4>Payment reconciliation</h4><dl><div><dt>Change & intent</dt><dd>Linked ✓</dd></div><div><dt>Tests & security</dt><dd>Attached ✓</dd></div><div><dt>Senior approval</dt><dd class="missing-record">Missing</dd></div><div><dt>Production outcome</dt><dd>Awaiting release</dd></div></dl><p>The evidence shows both what is known and what is still needed.</p></div></div><div class="sheet-insight"><span>✦</span><p><strong>One traceable release decision.</strong> Intent, code and checks are linked. Senior approval is still needed.</p></div></div></section>
</div>
<div class="stack-controls"><div role="group" aria-label="Choose product insight"><button type="button" data-stack-tab="0" aria-pressed="true">01 <span>AI value</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-tab="1" aria-pressed="false">02 <span>Release confidence</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-tab="2" aria-pressed="false">03 <span>Evidence</span></button></div><button type="button" id="stack-next" aria-label="Next insight">→</button></div><p class="stack-hint" id="stack-status" aria-live="polite">01 / 03 · AI investment & developer productivity</p>
</div>
<script>
const stack=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.insight-stack')!;
const sheets=Array.from(stack.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-sheet]'));
const tabs=Array.from(stack.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-stack-tab]'));
const names=['AI investment & developer productivity','Release confidence','Connected release evidence'];let selected=0;
function show(index:number){selected=index;sheets.forEach((sheet,i)=>{sheet.dataset.depth=String((i-index+3)%3);sheet.inert=i!==index;sheet.setAttribute('aria-hidden',String(i!==index));});tabs.forEach((button,i)=>button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(i===index)));stack.querySelector('#stack-status')!.textContent=`0${index+1} / 03 · ${names[index]}`;}
tabs.forEach((button,i)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>show(i)));
stack.querySelector('#stack-next')!.addEventListener('click',()=>show((selected+1)%3));
document.querySelector('#play')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{show((selected+1)%3);});
stack.querySelector('#stack-policy-toggle')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{const button=stack.querySelector('#stack-policy-toggle')!;const open=button.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';button.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));stack.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#stack-policy-detail')!.hidden=!open;});
show(1);
</script>
